      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>If Sangrimm moves 20+ feet in a straight line, he gains a Fly Speed equal to his Walk Speed until the end of the turn and can move through the spaces of Medium or smaller creatures as if they were Difficult Terrain. A creature whose space Sangrimm moves through in this way for the first time on a turn is subjected to the following effect: <em>Saving Throw:</em> DC 18 Dexterity. <em>Failure:</em> 3 (1d6) Bludgeoning damage, and the target is knocked Prone.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
