      "type": "feat",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><strong>Ability:</strong> Charisma; <strong>DC:</strong> 18; <strong>Modifier:</strong> +10. Sangrimm is an innate spellcaster and doesn't require Material components.</p><p><strong>At Will:</strong> <em>Bless</em> (C), <em>Bane</em> (C)</p><p><strong>5/Day:</strong> <em>Death Ward</em>, <em>Enhance Ability</em>, <em>Fly</em> (C), <em>Freedom of Movement</em>, <em>Haste</em> (C), <em>Polymorph</em> (C), <em>Regenerate</em>, <em>True Seeing</em></p><p>(C) indicates Concentration. Remember Dealmaker: these spells must target a willing creature other than Sangrimm.</p>",
          "chat": ""
